    {
      "id": "58da5a3a-66c3-4c39-95e9-cf1c07131835",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2176,
        544
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 768,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "### Data Ingestion & Context\n* Connects to a Notion CRM to fetch the active list of suppliers.\n* dynamically injects supplier names into a REST API (News API) to pull live global headlines related to labor strikes, human rights violations, or compliance failures."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "90f4d8fd-8612-422b-9924-7264d7920f96",
      "name": "Start Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "position": [
        2256,
        768
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c15aa6f3-108b-42f7-9008-dd92f3cbdc2a",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3008,
        496
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 960,
        "height": 704,
        "content": "AI Risk Analysis & Dynamic Routing\n* **Groq LLM** parses unstructured news data to detect specific violation signals.\n* Forces strict JSON output formatting.\n* A logic gate (IF Node) instantly evaluates the parsed boolean (`violation_detected`), filtering out safe suppliers and routing at-risk suppliers forward."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5be89076-e02b-4b4e-93ce-b2384e824466",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        4032,
        496
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 992,
        "height": 704,
        "content": "### Database Enrichment \n* Intercepts the risk alert and queries a **MongoDB** `supplier_contracts` collection.\n* Matches the Notion supplier name to the MongoDB document to retrieve real-time contract values and financial penalty clauses.\n* Flattens and merges external risk data with internal database logic into a single, clean payload."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e91d57f7-46b0-4979-afba-2d222dc6633e",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        5088,
        496
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1248,
        "height": 704,
        "content": "Multi-Channel Automated Action\n* A secondary AI agent reads the enriched data and drafts a legally sound, data-backed warning email.\n* Automatically saves the drafted warning directly to the Procurement Manager's Gmail Drafts folder.\n* Pings a dedicated Slack channel with a formatted risk alert.\n* Logs the timestamp, status change (`At Risk`), and the AI's action plan back into the Notion database."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "796bbc44-e3fb-4a33-9401-7fc772311515",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        6400,
        496
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 704,
        "content": "### Dead Letter Queue (DLQ) & Error Handling\n* Built-in asynchronous error-catching branch.\n* If any node fails (e.g., API timeout, bad credentials), the workflow catches the error and pings a DevOps Slack channel with the raw JSON stack trace for immediate debugging."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "88fef921-9a8a-49bb-96ca-58017ef6a011",
      "name": "Sticky Note6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1248,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 848,
        "height": 704,
        "content": "## Overview\nAn n8n pipeline that monitors global news for supplier compliance risks, enriches alerts with MongoDB contract data, and uses Groq AI to automatically draft warnings and update Notion.\n\n## How It Works\n1. **Fetch & Scan:** Pulls suppliers from Notion and scans live news via API.\n2. **AI Analysis:** Groq LLM evaluates news for violations and outputs structured JSON.\n3. **Data Enrichment:** If risk is detected, fetches the supplier's contract details from MongoDB.\n4. **Automated Action:** AI drafts a warning email to Gmail Drafts, alerts Slack, and updates the Notion CRM.\n5. **Error Handling:** A built-in trigger catches failures and routes raw error logs to Slack.\n\n## Quick Setup\n1. **Import:** Load `workflow.json` into your n8n instance.\n2. **Credentials:** Add keys/OAuth for Notion, News API, Groq, MongoDB, Gmail, and Slack.\n3. **Databases:** * **Notion:** Create table with `Supplier Name`, `Risk Status`, `Last Violation Date`, `AI Action Plan`.\n   * **MongoDB:** Create `ProcurementDB` > `supplier_contracts` collection (ensure `company_name` matches Notion).\n4. **Deploy:** Toggle the workflow to **Active**."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
